## Reviewer disagreements (not applied)

- fil-a #17. servicesAssistanceBefore already ends with a space and servicesAssistanceAfter starts with a space, but the link sits between them (`before` + link + `after`). The rendered line is “pahinang Makipag-ugnayan kung paano…”, one space on each side of the link. Removing the After space would glue “Makipag-ugnayan” to “kung”.
- fil-a #1 is not a disagreement about the URL. flno=3 is Article 3 of 各類所得扣繳率標準. The digit stays 10 only because the checker counts the Korean source’s 제10조. Noted under skipped, not “corrected” to 3.
- fil-a #15 / fil-b #11. The zero-width lines do split the spoken columns. Deleting them, or turning Q16–Q20 into headings, fails the blocks/headings checks against the Korean source. Not a wording fix the checker will accept.
- fil-a #14. “milyon” is what a Philippine reader expects, and the decimal point is already right. The standing rule pins the token TWD 1.57M, so the bio sentence was not rewritten.

